flowchart TD
  Task[TaskBoundary body / task VM]
  SetupWork -->|phase 0 only, after Cluster proof| Maintenance[Fixed-target maintenance read]
  Maintenance -.->|monitor, no link| Helper[Per-call helper]
  Helper -.->|owned reply alias; before absolute success deadline| Maintenance
  Helper -->|dev fixed connector: start_link| Pool[DBConnection pool]
  Pool -->|existing Watcher watch/unwatch| Tree[Connection supervisor]
  Tree --> Connection[Owned socket connection]
  Helper -->|test-seam build only; no socket| Fake[Reviewed fake pool]
  Maintenance -->|expiry: invalidate saved reply, kill helper| Grace[Cleanup-only acknowledgement waits]
  Grace -->|unknown cleanup is never facts| Refusal[Unavailable / cleanup-unacknowledged]
  Task -->|non-setup operator entry| Session[Session / RepoState observation]
  Session -->|not_started only: parent-owned start_link| Repo[Ecto Repo supervisor]
  Session -.->|started outside transaction: reuse only| Existing[Existing owner's Repo]
  Session -->|raced already_started: winner untouched| Error[Value-free RepoStartError]
  Task -.->|parent-specific OTP exit / VM shutdown, not stop-on-return| Repo
  Task -.->|VM shutdown is terminal residual for orphan helper| Helper
  Terminal[Wired: sdr.prototype.import run/1] -->|Mix app.config requirement; SafeLog.attach; TaskBoundary.launch/3| Launch
  SetupTerminal[Wired: sdr.prototype.setup run/1] -->|Mix app.config requirement; SafeLog.attach; TaskBoundary.launch/3| Launch
  OpTerminal[Wired: sdr.prototype.op run/1] -->|Mix app.config requirement; SafeLog.attach; TaskBoundary.launch/3| Launch
  ServeTerminal[Wired: sdr.prototype.serve run/1] -->|Mix app.config requirement; SafeLog.attach; TaskBoundary.launch/3| Launch
  ProvisionTerminal[Wired: sdr.prototype.provision run/1] -->|Mix app.config requirement; SafeLog.attach; TaskBoundary.launch/3| Launch
  Session -->|op assign only: enqueue? true; ensure_all_started :oban| InsertOnly[Task-local insert-only Oban: no queues, plugins, peer or stager]
  InsertOnly -->|configured engine| Basic[Oban.Engines.Basic]
  ClosedEngine[ClosedErrorEngine] -.->|conditional, not wired under D-256: delegates callbacks| Basic
  Planned[Other prototype tasks: launch wiring planned] -.->|planned: attach then launch/3| Launch
  Harness[Measured A1 harness: fresh no-start VM] -->|SafeLog.attach, then TaskBoundary.launch/3| Launch[launch/3: admission, attach, entry guard]
  Launch -->|outermost only; any non-:ok is entry abort, no rollback| Eligible{E: pinned, Mix-launched, non-ExUnit, product-free VM}
  Eligible -->|eligible| P1[P1 Mix.PubSub: exact entry terminated + deleted; absent skipped]
  P1 -->|:ok| P2[P2 Mix.Sync.PubSub: exact entry terminated + deleted; absent skipped]
  P2 -->|:ok| P3[P3 ssl_handler: original formatter-only update + re-read; absent or normalized skipped]
  P3 -->|:ok| Body[Body process: K0 entry token]
  Body -->|import body: OTel start and parse| Task
  Body -->|setup body: OTel start and strict fresh argv parse| SetupGuard[ContainmentGuard.guard setup]
  SetupGuard -->|only :ok| SetupWork[Setup.run with lazy real effects]
  SetupWork -->|phase 0: read-only, ordered checks| Cluster[Cluster identity proof]
  Cluster -->|owned paths and bounded marker read| Marker[CLUSTER, data/global/control metadata]
  Cluster -->|fixed id and pg_controldata via ChildEnv; captured output| Commands[UID and control identifier]
  SetupWork -->|after phase 0; RepoState before storage| Storage{Fresh target absent?}
  Storage -->|existing or uncertain: no adoption| SetupRefusal[Closed setup refusal or outer abort]
  Storage -->|absent only| Create[Real adapter storage_up]
  Create -->|created only| WithRepo[Ecto.Migrator.with_repo temporary start or reuse]
  WithRepo -->|top level; target, migrations, freshness checks| Bootstrap[Phase 2 Authority.bootstrap commits]
  Bootstrap -->|explicit configured instance UUID| SeedPhase[Phase 3 BootCheck, operator resolver, Seed.run]
  SeedPhase -->|Seed.run top level| SeedRun[Seed.run: nested refusal, live actor, pure pin and content precheck]
  SeedPhase -->|seed refusal: phase 2 remains committed| Partial[Bound, unseeded; not full setup success]
  SeedRun -->|one Audit.transaction| SeedLock[Binding FOR UPDATE, live recheck, history]
  SeedLock -->|exact complete history: replay, no writes, never reactivates| SeedDone[ids and digests: created or replay]
  SeedLock -->|empty history| SeedScopeRun[SeedScope.run: registered transaction scope, prototype only]
  SeedScopeRun -->|scoped provenance Payload; settings twice; ICP, sequence, step, campaign creates with ordered binds| SeedActivate[Scope-checked activate: ICP, then sequence, then campaign]
  SeedActivate -->|commit| SeedDone
  SeedLock -.->|any refusal or late failure: whole seed rolls back| Partial
  Body -->|op seed body: OTel, parse, Session enqueue? false| OpSeedGuard[ContainmentGuard.guard op]
  OpSeedGuard -->|only :ok| OpSeedWork[SeedDir.read P,G,C,V pins; one seed_result or seed_refused line]
  OpSeedWork -->|top level| SeedRun
  OpSeedWork -.->|retry of a bound, unseeded target: no real seed run proven| Partial
  Session -->|import only: successful entry| Guard[ContainmentGuard.guard import]
  Body -->|A1 harness only: OTel started before launch| Guard
  Guard -->|:ok import only| ImportWork[Protected readers; prepare; domain import; cap and closed output]
  Guard -->|:ok A1 only| HarnessDone[A1 harness result]
